        {
          "groupId": 1196253,
          "name": "The video features a singles tennis match between Jack Draper and Carlos Alcaraz in an Australian open  match at Melbourne. Alcaraz wins the match with the scores of 7-5, 6-1. Alcaraz wins the first set of the match in a close points match  with a scores of 7-5.  Alcaraz, then completely dominates the second set of the match, winning the set with a score of 6-1. Draper tries hard but fails to get a proper comeback in the second set.  Alcaraz dominates the match with powerful serves.\n ",
